4. Scenarios and Mission Profiles

Define canonical mission profiles for validation:

Scenario S1 — Autonomous cargo logistics
   •   Repeated maneuver windows
   •   Periodic payload operations
   •   Minimal ground support

Scenario S2 — Crew support platform (cooperative autonomy)
   •   Human-in-loop overrides
   •   Safety constraints emphasized
   •   Thermal/energy under crew load

Scenario S3 — Deep-space exploration
   •   Long comm delays
   •   Environmental uncertainty (radiation storms)
   •   High autonomy demand

Scenario S4 — Infrastructure building / servicing
   •   Frequent attitude reorientation
   •   Continuous power draw
   •   Fault-tolerant scheduling under high load

Each scenario defines:
   •   mission timeline
   •   task list and priorities
   •   constraints and acceptable deviations

