5. Disturbance Models

5.1 Environmental
   •   Solar radiation pressure (SRP) perturbations
   •   Thermal sink variation (sun/shadow cycles)
   •   Radiation event intensity spikes
   •   Dust/plume contamination (scenario-dependent)

5.2 Sensor noise and drift
   •   Bias + random walk for inertial sensors
   •   Star tracker dropouts
   •   Optical nav measurement noise
   •   Temperature sensor offset drift

5.3 Actuator imperfections
   •   Reaction wheel saturation
   •   Thruster misalignment
   •   Power converter efficiency changes with temperature
   •   Heater failures / stuck valves

