11. Reproducibility and Open Research Packaging

11.1 Artifact structure (recommended)
   •   /sim/ scenario definitions + config YAML/JSON
   •   /models/ dynamics, thermal, power, faults
   •   /autonomy/ planner, reflex, governance
   •   /metrics/ evaluation + plots
   •   /runs/ stored run manifests (hashes, seeds, versions)

11.2 Run manifest (per trial)

Store:
   •   seed
   •   scenario id
   •   fault list
   •   code version hash
   •   parameter hash
   •   outputs + summary metrics

This enables “paper-to-code” traceability.

