12. Minimal Demonstration Experiment Set

If you want a clean first publication result set:
	1.	Nominal: no faults, moderate disturbances
	2.	Comms-latency: 30–120 min delays + periodic blackouts
	3.	Radiation storm: dose spike events + sensor resets
	4.	Power degradation: battery SOH decline + solar array degradation
	5.	Compound: combined faults + high uncertainty

Run each with B0–B3 baselines.
